        {
          "id": "d043a143-ad0c-4ecb-8f7f-0756a424fc3b",
          "name": "Remove scheduled clinician from shift",
          "request": {
            "name": "Remove scheduled clinician from shift",
            "description": {
              "content": "<h3><strong>Remove a Scheduled Clinician from a Shift</strong></h3>\n<p>This operation removes a scheduled clinician from a shift under specific conditions and notifies relevant parties accordingly.</p>\n<h4><strong>Shift Status Updates</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>If the <strong>shift has at least 1 hour remaining</strong>, it is returned to the &quot;Open&quot; status.</li>\n<li>Otherwise, the shift is set to <strong>UnfulfilledRequested</strong> and will no longer be offered to clinicians.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>Notifications</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>The <strong>removed clinician</strong> is notified about their removal from the shift.</li>\n<li>If the <strong>removal reason</strong> is <code>Remove hire refused to work</code>:\n<ul>\n<li>The clinician's status will be updated to <strong>&quot;frozen&quot;</strong>.</li>\n<li>If the shift <strong>has started</strong> or was in progress:\n<ul>\n<li>The clinician will be removed from any other scheduled shifts if there were previous removals for No Call No Show (NCNS).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>Returning the Shift to the Marketplace</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>If the shift is reopened and sent back to the marketplace:\n<ul>\n<li>Other clinicians who previously <strong>requested the shift</strong> will be notified so they can reapply.</li>\n<li><strong>Clinician candidates</strong> eligible to fill the shift will receive an <strong>SOS notification</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v2",
                "public",
                "scheduled-shifts",
                "remove-clinician"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{bearerToken}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"shiftId\": \"<string>\",\n  \"clinicianId\": \"<string>\",\n  \"removalReason\": \"<string>\",\n  \"comments\": \"<string>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
